<section><div class="wrap narrow"><p>Tell us about the products, quantities, intended application and delivery requirements for your enquiry.</p><?php if(pt_local()): ?><div class="notice">Local test: your enquiry and attachments are saved on this computer. Email is captured locally, not delivered. Please use fictional details.</div><?php else: ?><div class="notice">Your enquiry will be sent securely to PANDATEC. Please provide accurate contact details and do not upload confidential information unless authorised.</div><?php endif; ?><div id="form-selection"></div><button class="text-link" data-quote>Edit quote list</button><form id="enquiry-form"><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name *<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="200" required></label><label>Company<input name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="200"></label><label>Email address *<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="200" required></label><label>Telephone<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="200"></label></div><label>Requirements *<textarea name="requirements" rows="6" maxlength="8000" required placeholder="Application, quantity, dimensions, materials, delivery location or project brief"></textarea></label><label class="file-label">Supporting files (optional)<input type="file" name="attachments[]" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" multiple></label><p class="field-note">Up to 3 PDF, PNG or JPG files, maximum 5 MB each. Attachments are stored privately and made available only to authorised staff.</p><label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label><p class="field-note">Fields and retention wording must match the approved website privacy notice before launch. See the <a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(home_url('/privacy-policy/')); ?>">privacy notice</a>.</p><p id="form-error" class="error" role="alert"></p><button class="btn" type="submit">Preview enquiry</button>